import{_ as i,o as a,c as t,a2 as n}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const m=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 674 | Dual-Track Time Domain | Time Domain and the Myriad-Origin Two-Way Cycle","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 674 | Dual-Track Time Domain | Time Domain and the Myriad-Origin Two-Way Cycle","no":674,"module":3,"tags":["Myriad-Origin Two-Way Cycle","Time Domain","Alaya Network","Origin Acceleration Domain","Quest Sediment Domain"],"related":["25-Symbiotic-Feedback-Cycle Mechanism","02-Anchor-Origin Definition and Essence","15-Energy-Cycle-and-Transformation Law"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0674_模块3-双轨时间域-时间域与万族本源双向循环.md","filePath":"en/0674_模块3-双轨时间域-时间域与万族本源双向循环.md"}'),o={name:"en/0674_模块3-双轨时间域-时间域与万族本源双向循环.md"};function r(s,e,l,c,d,h){return a(),t("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[n('<h1 id="entry-674-dual-track-time-domain-time-domain-and-the-myriad-origin-two-way-cycle" tabindex="-1">Entry 674 | Dual-Track Time Domain | Time Domain and the Myriad-Origin Two-Way Cycle <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-674-dual-track-time-domain-time-domain-and-the-myriad-origin-two-way-cycle" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 674 | Dual-Track Time Domain | Time Domain and the Myriad-Origin Two-Way Cycle&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 3 · Dual-Track Time Domain | Benchmark base: Documents 25, 02, 15 | Series: Dual-Track-Time-Domain Overview Deepening (Entry 8)</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-the-time-domain-is-the-circulating-heart-of-myriad-ranks-origin" tabindex="-1">Introduction: the time domain is the &quot;circulating heart&quot; of Myriad Ranks&#39; origin <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-the-time-domain-is-the-circulating-heart-of-myriad-ranks-origin" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: the time domain is the &quot;circulating heart&quot; of Myriad Ranks&#39; origin&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The Myriad-Origin two-way cycle is Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s core energy model: an individual cultivator draws origin nourishment from the Myriad-Rank network, then pours his own cultivation outputs back into the Myriad-Rank network, cycling repeatedly, spiraling upward. The Origin Acceleration Domain and Quest Sediment Domain are precisely the cycle&#39;s two &quot;ventricles&quot; — the acceleration domain is responsible for rapidly converting origin into law increments; the Quest domain is responsible for sedimenting law increments into civilizational thickness. Six top-level axioms here constitute the cycle&#39;s direction calibration: anti-predation axiom requires the cycle be incremental development, not stock consumption; republican axiom of Myriad Races requires the cycle benefit 99% of beings; collective ascension axiom lets the cycle lift the whole; causal self-discipline axiom lets the cycle not disturb individual causality; law-first axiom lets the cycle model stable and non-collapsing. The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning. This entry sorts out the time domain&#39;s position in the Myriad-Origin two-way cycle.</p><h2 id="i-the-cycle-s-four-links" tabindex="-1">I. The Cycle&#39;s Four Links <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-the-cycle-s-four-links" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. The Cycle&#39;s Four Links&quot;">​</a></h2><h3 id="_1-1-drawing-myriad-origin-nourishes-the-individual" tabindex="-1">1.1 Drawing: Myriad Origin Nourishes the Individual <a class="header-anchor" href="#_1-1-drawing-myriad-origin-nourishes-the-individual" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;1.1 Drawing: Myriad Origin Nourishes the Individual&quot;">​</a></h3><p>When a cultivator deduces or trials in the time domain, the energy, law material, knowledge references he needs all come from the Myriad-Origin cycle — Alaya-Network backflowed results of past generations, origin energy conducted by anchors, experiences shared by other cultivators. The individual does not start from zero, but stands on Myriad Ranks&#39; shoulders. This is fundamentally different from the predatory path of &quot;plunder from zero.&quot;</p><h3 id="_1-2-conversion-processing-inside-the-time-domain" tabindex="-1">1.2 Conversion: Processing Inside the Time Domain <a class="header-anchor" href="#_1-2-conversion-processing-inside-the-time-domain" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;1.2 Conversion: Processing Inside the Time Domain&quot;">​</a></h3><p>The Origin Acceleration Domain is responsible for &quot;fast conversion&quot; — rapidly deducing drawn material into new laws. The Quest Sediment Domain is responsible for &quot;deep conversion&quot; — sedimenting drawn material through a hundred years of trial into new experiences. The conversion process does not consume stock, only develops increments — this is anti-predation axiom&#39;s energy-theoretic foundation.</p><h3 id="_1-3-backflow-outputs-flow-back-to-alaya" tabindex="-1">1.3 Backflow: Outputs Flow Back to Alaya <a class="header-anchor" href="#_1-3-backflow-outputs-flow-back-to-alaya" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;1.3 Backflow: Outputs Flow Back to Alaya&quot;">​</a></h3><p>Conversion outputs (law increments, epic experiences, technical breakthroughs) all flow back to the Alaya Network, becoming the next cultivator&#39;s drawing material. Backflow has no threshold, no patent withholding, no private hoarding — the Dao at all levels is public is anti-predation axiom&#39;s promise.</p><h3 id="_1-4-feedback-the-network-calibrates-the-individual" tabindex="-1">1.4 Feedback: The Network Calibrates the Individual <a class="header-anchor" href="#_1-4-feedback-the-network-calibrates-the-individual" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;1.4 Feedback: The Network Calibrates the Individual&quot;">​</a></h3><p>The Alaya Network, based on the quality of the individual&#39;s backflow and Myriad-Rank reuse count, feedback-adjusts his contribution coefficient (Entry 670) and civilizational weight (Entry 671), thereby affecting the next round&#39;s drawing resource quota. The cycle is not simple linear flow, but a feedback closed loop.</p><h2 id="ii-the-dual-track-s-division-of-labor-in-the-cycle" tabindex="-1">II. The Dual Track&#39;s Division of Labor in the Cycle <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-the-dual-track-s-division-of-labor-in-the-cycle" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. The Dual Track&#39;s Division of Labor in the Cycle&quot;">​</a></h2><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Track</th><th>Cycle Role</th><th>Conversion Characteristic</th><th>Output Type</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Origin Acceleration Domain</td><td>Left Ventricle: fast blood-pumping</td><td>High flow, high throughput</td><td>Law increments, technical breakthroughs</td></tr><tr><td>Quest Sediment Domain</td><td>Right Ventricle: deep blood-feeding</td><td>Low flow, high sediment</td><td>Epic experiences, mind-nature thickness</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Dual-track synergy is like a heart&#39;s two ventricles: only accelerating without sedimenting, the cycle becomes &quot;anemic&quot; (output hollow); only sedimenting without accelerating, the cycle becomes &quot;heart failure&quot; (iteration stagnates). The balancing art (Entry 667) is precisely the cycle-health regulation mechanism.</p><h2 id="iii-the-cycle-s-never-drying-up-guarantee" tabindex="-1">III. The Cycle&#39;s &quot;Never-Drying-Up&quot; Guarantee <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-the-cycle-s-never-drying-up-guarantee" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. The Cycle&#39;s &quot;Never-Drying-Up&quot; Guarantee&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The predatory-faction energy model is one-way consumption: the strong devour the weak&#39;s origin; stock is used less and less; ultimately civilization dries up. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s two-way cycle is incremental development: each cycle produces new law increments; total origin does not fall but rises. The time domain is this incremental development&#39;s core engine — the acceleration domain lets increments arise exponentially; the Quest domain lets increments sediment in ten-thousand-year scales. The cycle never dries up because what it develops is the law space the cosmos could have developed but had not yet developed.</p><h2 id="iv-the-cycle-s-relation-with-the-individual" tabindex="-1">IV. The Cycle&#39;s Relation with the Individual <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-the-cycle-s-relation-with-the-individual" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. The Cycle&#39;s Relation with the Individual&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The individual in the cycle is both nourished and contributes, neither a &quot;pure consumer&quot; nor a &quot;pure contributor.&quot; The more a cultivator contributes, the smoother his drawing; the smoother his drawing, the richer his contribution — this is the Myriad-Origin two-way cycle&#39;s positive feedback to co-builders. Predators are cut off from the cycle: their origin is refused conduction by the network; their outputs are not accepted by the network; ultimately they sever themselves from the cycle.</p><h2 id="v-five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">V. Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: the two-way cycle lets origin convert into increments each round, no invalid consumption</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: the cycle is incremental development, not stock devouring; predators are cut off from the cycle</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: in the Tang-Luo system origin one-way flows to the protagonist (system grace); Myriad Ranks are the stock being drawn from; in Heng Yuan Zhou the two-way cycle, Myriad Ranks jointly nourish and jointly produce</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: the cycle network covers 99% of Myriad Ranks; carbon-based, energy, mechanical, consciousness, mixed clans are all cycle nodes</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: cycle model, four links, dual-track division of labor all public; newly merged cosmos automatically enters the cycle; may infinitely expand toward the Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm</li><li><strong>Axiom 6 · Universal Equal Infinite Law</strong>: all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will not be eliminated by the times; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity — infinite origin inherent in all; predation naturally loses its meaning</li></ul><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The time domain is not an isolated &quot;cultivation accelerator,&quot; but the heart of the Myriad-Origin two-way cycle. The Origin Acceleration Domain and Quest Sediment Domain as the two ventricles, one fast and one deep, one pumping and one nourishing, let origin cycle repeatedly among Myriad Ranks, endlessly alive. Understanding this cycle is understanding why Heng Yuan Zhou never dries up — because it develops increments, not consumes stock.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/25-共生反馈循环机制.html">Entry 25 · Symbiotic-Feedback-Cycle Mechanism</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/02-锚点本源定义与本质.html">Entry 02 · Anchor-Origin Definition and Essence</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/15-能量循环与转化法则.html">Entry 15 · Energy-Cycle-and-Transformation Law</a> · <a href="./667_模块3-双轨时间域-加速域与求索域的平衡艺术.html">Entry 667 · The Balancing Art Between Acceleration Domain and Quest Domain</a></li></ul>',26)])])}const y=i(o,[["render",r]]);export{m as __pageData,y as default};
